<section class="content-section"><div class="shell content-grid"><div><div class="eyebrow">Operating position</div><h2>Serious industrial problems. Governed technology.</h2></div><div class="content-copy"><p>TechSafeAI starts with the client problem, operating context and accountable people. Technology supports consulting work where it improves retrieval, organisation, analysis support, workflow or repeatability.</p><p>Human accountability remains visible at consequential decision points. Security boundaries are established before protected information is requested.</p><p class="notice">Initial sector depth is Mining & Resources and Construction & Infrastructure. Other risk-intensive and regulated organisations have a legitimate problem-led route without unsupported claims of sector specialism.</p></div></div></section>
